## 1. Original Starter Kit Components

Copyright © 2026 AGY Thesis Starter Kit Author.

Applies to all original files listed in Section 1 of [`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`](./THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md) (`AGENTS.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `README.md`, `PROJECT_STATUS.md`, `.agents/rules/`, `.agents/skills/thesis-autopilot/`, `.agents/skills/stun-thesis-writer/`, `scripts/`, `templates/Template_STUN_Blank.docx`, and `docs/`):

### Permitted Use (Authorized Users)
1. Use and customize this starter kit in full to research, draft, format, and export your own personal Thesis Proposal and Complete Thesis (including modifying scripts, templates, and configs for your own academic research).
2. Publish and submit the resulting generated documents (`.docx`, `.pdf`, tables, and figures) as your own academic work.

### Prohibited Use
1. **No Commercial Reselling or Repackaging:** You may not resell, rent, sublicense, or commercially redistribute the original starter kit components as a standalone or competing paid product without prior written permission from the author.
2. **No Attribution Removal:** You may not remove `LICENSE`, `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`, or any third-party `LICENSE` files inside the bundled skill directories.

